[]($image.siteAsset('profile.jpg').attrs('profile'))

Welcome to my little website! I'm a hacker who writes here about software,
especially open source, and politics, ethics, and philosophy.

I like getting emails so if you have comments or feedback on anything you read
here, feel free to [reach out directly] or to write to my [public inbox]. It
might take me several days to get to your email.

The content for this site is [CC-BY-SA] and the [source code] is [MIT].

